{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act19side_level_act19side_02_end",
  "groupId": "act19side",
  "stageId": "act19side_02",
  "title": "拓荒者小屋",
  "storyCode": "DV-2",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act19side/level_act19side_02_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "d95357f56d6ca8a9780a39e3743bc0edda7501e9a9ef00322976e90e7c61c137",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mechanist",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_521_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mechanist",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_521_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我得承认，我没想到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我也没想到。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "直到我看到塞雷娅动手......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_532_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "你们放心，我也并不想再进一次监狱。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mechanist",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_521_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "那这现场处理起来就容易多了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mechanist",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_521_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "毕竟，我是个机械师，拆解一具机械花不了多少时间。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mechanist",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_521_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "不过......你是怎么知道它里面是空心的？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_532_1#10$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我和这批动力甲交手过几次。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mechanist",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_521_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "你也被它们追杀过？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_532_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "算是吧。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "它们不是塞雷娅的对手。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "反过来还差不多......",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mechanist",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_521_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "既然它们出现在这里，那说明有人并不希望我们追查缪尔赛思的下落。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mechanist",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_521_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "这个人会是谁？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_532_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "有多种可能性。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_532_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我与缪尔赛思联络不多，只知道她在失踪前正在参与某项由莱茵生命主导的秘密实验。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_532_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "考虑到我早已离开莱茵，她向我透露上述信息已经违反保密协议。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mechanist",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_521_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "莱茵防卫科会出动尖端武器干掉泄密的员工吗？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_532_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mechanist",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_521_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我知道了，这也是保密条款。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mechanist",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_521_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "罗德岛真是良心企业，是吧，Dr.{@nickname}？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "罗德岛不仅仅是一家企业。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "要不然也招募不到你们。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_532_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "缪尔赛思不是莱茵生命的普通员工。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_532_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "能将她逼至绝境，对方的专业程度不亚于我。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_532_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "这种型号的动力甲大约在半年前出现在了某些雇佣兵团体中。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_532_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "它所使用的防御材料与装配武器都并不出彩，整体性能与五年前的军方量产动力甲相当。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_532_1#10$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "只有一点很特殊——它对使用者没有要求。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mechanist",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_521_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "没有要求......是多低的要求？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_532_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "任何生理指标能维持一般运动状态的个体都能满足要求。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_532_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我可以，Mechanist先生可以，博士也可以。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mechanist",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_521_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "那是够低的了。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "我还真想试试。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Mechanist",
              "speakerToken": "avg_npc_521_1#1$1",
              "operatorId": null,
              "portraitKey": null,
              "text": "你不会喜欢这感觉的，博士，我向你保证。"
            },
            {
              "type": "sceneBreak"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mechanist",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_521_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "以前能穿动力甲的都是精锐士兵。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mechanist",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_521_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "能控制那大玩意儿在战场上长时间搏杀，而不是蹦几下就淹死在自己的呕吐物里——真不是未经训练的人能做到的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mechanist",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_521_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "你问问坚雷就知道了。她说她当时只穿过一次就满脑子想着退役。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mechanist",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_521_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我相信几年时间足够让那帮人把技术迭代几十次了，而且雇佣兵里本来就不乏退役士兵......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mechanist",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_521_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "但谁都能穿？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mechanist",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_521_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "这搞不好是能颠覆战争方式的发明。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_532_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "目前类似的动力甲流到外面的数量极少，可见这项技术还只是在原型阶段。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_532_1#10$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我正在追查它的来源。和其他许多实验性武器一样，要获得线索并不容易。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "哥伦比亚的雇佣兵这么有钱？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "这动力甲技术非常先进吧？",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mechanist",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_521_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "雇佣兵们未必是客户。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mechanist",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_521_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "在下这批订单的人眼里，雇佣兵跟这新型动力甲没有区别——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_532_1#10$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "——都只是实验品而已。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_532_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "移动城市投影的边缘往往也是文明法则是否适用的分界线。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_532_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "这些活跃在荒地上的雇佣兵，和那些拓荒者一样，都是最方便的实验对象。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_532_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "即使实验失败了，他们被消耗掉了，也很少有人去追究他们的下落。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_532_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "而且很快，又会有下一批实验品被补充进来。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "没人反对？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_532_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "反对缺乏意义。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_532_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "雇佣兵们很清楚，手里拿着的新型武器可能会爆炸，但也可能比对手的武器威力更强。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_532_1#10$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "在法律上，这些你情我愿的交易都是接近合规的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mechanist",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_521_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_532_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "Mechanist先生，你有什么新发现吗？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mechanist",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_521_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "不对劲......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mechanist",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_521_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "从刚刚开始，我就觉得哪里不对劲。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mechanist",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_521_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "这动力甲里面没有人——为什么我没有一眼看出来？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mechanist",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_521_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "不管是有雇佣兵在远处使用无线电遥控，还是设置了自动程序，都会有明显的模式规律。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "就像可露希尔的无人机。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "就像Lancet-2和Castle-3。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mechanist",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_521_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "显然，它们都不会这么灵活。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mechanist",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_521_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "在罗德岛研发的新一代武器当中，自动化程度最高的也远远无法骗过我的眼睛——你让我相信那帮被军队豢养的蠢笨机械师能做到？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_532_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "——"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mechanist",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_521_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "你在做什么？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_532_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "切断动力甲的“神经中枢”。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mechanist",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_521_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "这些导管里淌出来了......银色的液体。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mechanist",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_521_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "这是什么物质？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_532_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "或许它就是上述问题的答案。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_535_1#11$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "逃出来了......吗？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "speakerToken": "avg_108_silent_1#6$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "呼......我......我很久没跑这么快了......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "speakerToken": "avg_108_silent_1#6$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "那到底是......"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "形状奇特的物体",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_533_1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerToken": "avg_135_halo_1#7$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "它追出来了？！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_535_1#11$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "趴下！"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "speakerToken": "avg_108_silent_1#6$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "这不是刚才那个......"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "speakerToken": "avg_108_silent_1#5$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "至少有十多个，甚至更多，它们围住了居住区。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_535_1#11$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "它们......变多了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerToken": "avg_135_halo_1#6$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "变多了？你见过这种物体？你说清楚些！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_535_1#11$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......乌比卡博士，该说清楚的不是你吗？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerToken": "avg_135_halo_1#6$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "你在胡言乱语什么......？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "speakerToken": "avg_108_silent_1#4$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "躲开——！"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerToken": "avg_135_halo_1#6$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "——这东西移动得太快了！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerToken": "avg_135_halo_1#6$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "一旦被撞到的话后果不堪设想——我们是不是该回到室内？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_535_1#11$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "最好不要这么做。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerToken": "avg_135_halo_1#7$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "为什么？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "speakerToken": "avg_108_silent_1#5$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "那是......我们待的那间屋子......"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "在看不见的巨大力量的冲击下，拓荒者的小屋剧烈地摇晃着，并不算太牢靠的门窗纷纷开裂。\n几乎在同一时间，原本盘旋在半空的奇特物体都涌向了那间屋子。\n银色的液体飞快地渗进门窗的裂痕中，就如同闻到血腥味的微小生物前赴后继地钻进猎物的伤口里。\n而下一瞬间，令在场的科学家们都无法理解的事情发生了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerToken": "avg_135_halo_1#9$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "那间屋子是不是......消失了？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "speakerToken": "avg_108_silent_1#6$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "不，不是消失了——它被分解了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerToken": "avg_135_halo_1#7$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "分解？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "speakerToken": "avg_108_silent_1#6$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "看到空中那些......漂浮着的东西了吗？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerToken": "avg_135_halo_1#3$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "你是说，它们原本是屋子的一部分？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "speakerToken": "avg_108_silent_1#6$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "它们恐怕是屋子的全部。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "话音刚落，静止在空中的碎片纷纷落了下来。\n巨响、烟尘、满地残渣，就像被强行停止的时钟重新转动，本该存在的一切也都回来了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerToken": "avg_135_halo_1#7$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我......我是不是中了某种精神控制类的源石技艺？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerToken": "avg_135_halo_1#7$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "否则的话，我看到的一切怎么会都......不符合我所熟知的物理规则。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "speakerToken": "avg_108_silent_1#6$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......是那些银色液体干的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "speakerToken": "avg_108_silent_1#10$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "它们......分散成了无数细小的个体，拆解并带走了原本属于那间屋子的一部分......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "speakerToken": "avg_108_silent_1#6$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "然后它们重新聚合。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerToken": "avg_135_halo_1#3$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "就像有几十只看不见的......手？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_535_1#11$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "女士们，你们仿佛在谈论某种幽灵......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "speakerToken": "avg_108_silent_1#5$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "等等，白面鸮——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerToken": "avg_135_halo_1#7$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "完了，刚刚乔伊丝还在屋子里！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerToken": "avg_135_halo_1#7$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "她该不会也被......"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒队成员",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_534_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "咳......咳咳......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_535_1#7$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "迈尔！你也逃出来了？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒队成员",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_534_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "领、领队......我把......摩尔医生......带出来了......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "白面鸮",
          "speakerToken": "avg_128_plosis_1#8$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerToken": "avg_135_halo_1#7$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "乔伊丝！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒队成员",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_534_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "还、还好......她没事......"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "speakerToken": "avg_108_silent_1#6$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......他的伤势不算重，但是体力接近透支，急需休息。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_535_1#11$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我们不能留在这个地方。整个拓荒者居住区都不再安全。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "玛丽",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_527_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "你都看到了吗？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "莱茵防卫科成员",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_528_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我不知道您指的是什么。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "玛丽",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_527_1#5$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "别跟我装傻，刚才那震动你没感觉到？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "玛丽",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_527_1#5$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "那些飘来飘去的是什么新型号的无人机吗？你们莱茵自己研发的？该死！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "莱茵防卫科成员",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_528_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我只能向您保证，我们没有违反您的命令对基地采取任何行动。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "玛丽",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_527_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "你老大叫什么来着？斐尔迪南是吧？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "莱茵防卫科成员",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_528_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "斐尔迪南·克鲁尼先生是莱茵生命能量科的主任。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "玛丽",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_527_1#5$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我才不管你们公司是什么架构。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "玛丽",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_527_1#5$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "给我通讯器，我要跟他通话。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "莱茵防卫科成员",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_528_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "斐尔迪南主任非常忙碌......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "玛丽",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_527_1#5$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "那麻烦你给他发一条消息——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "玛丽",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_527_1#5$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "问问他知不知道自己有多混蛋！"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "莱茵实验员",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_529_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "主任，有您的消息，是从基地监控站发过来的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "斐尔迪南",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_522_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "斐尔迪南",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_522_1#2$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "呵呵......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "莱茵实验员",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_529_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "还有，您的儿子似乎也有事找您，是否接通通讯？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "斐尔迪南",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_522_1#2$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "老规矩，跟他说我很忙。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "斐尔迪南",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_522_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "对了，把埃琳娜最近一次报告的内容转到我的终端上。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "莱茵实验员",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_529_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "好的，斐尔迪南主任。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "斐尔迪南",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_522_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我说过很多次了吧？别再叫我主任。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "莱茵实验员",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_529_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "啊！对不起，斐尔迪南先生。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "斐尔迪南",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_522_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "说到埃琳娜......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "斐尔迪南",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_522_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "你和她关系还不错吧。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "斐尔迪南",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_522_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "替我想一想，她会喜欢什么样的礼物？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerToken": "avg_135_halo_1#3$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......奥利维亚。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "speakerToken": "avg_108_silent_1#8$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "抱歉，我忙着治疗受伤的拓荒者......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "speakerToken": "avg_108_silent_1#7$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "你有没有受伤？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerToken": "avg_135_halo_1#3$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我......还好。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerToken": "avg_135_halo_1#3$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我没有你的外勤经验，但顾好自己还是做得到的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerToken": "avg_135_halo_1#3$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "可是......我们难道不应该赶紧撤离吗？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerToken": "avg_135_halo_1#3$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "现在基地乱作一团......拓荒者自顾不暇。这是我们逃出去的好时机。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerToken": "avg_135_halo_1#3$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "主任肯定收到了消息，他会派人来接我们。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerToken": "avg_135_halo_1#3$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "等我们和防卫科的同事会合，就一定能解除基地的威胁，救出多萝西......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "speakerToken": "avg_108_silent_1#7$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "或许你是对的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerToken": "avg_135_halo_1#4$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "或许？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "speakerToken": "avg_108_silent_1#7$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "但是我做不到。我没法抛下他们不管。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "speakerToken": "avg_108_silent_1#7$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "你看到了......他们刚刚同样没有抛下乔伊丝。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_535_1#11$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "赫默医生，这里又有几个人受伤！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "speakerToken": "avg_108_silent_1#4$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "无人机——！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_535_1#11$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "再这样下去，我们撑不了多久。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_535_1#8$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "所有攻击手段我都试过了，没用。那些怪物既不会受伤，也无法被破坏。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_535_1#8$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我们甚至......无处躲藏。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒队成员",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_534_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "领队，你跟她们说这些做什么？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒队成员",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_534_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "她们说不定正高兴着呢！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒队成员",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_534_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我们头顶上这些就是警察和大公司派出来的神秘武器！他们想要我们永远走不出这个基地——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_535_1#8$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "萨姆，先别说这些。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "格雷伊",
          "speakerToken": "avg_1027_greyy2_1#6$2",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "咳咳......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "格雷伊",
          "speakerToken": "avg_1027_greyy2_1#6$2",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "各位，我......我有一个猜想......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "speakerToken": "avg_108_silent_1#5$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "格雷伊......你有什么办法吗？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "格雷伊",
          "speakerToken": "avg_1027_greyy2_1#6$2",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "呼......呼......咳咳咳......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "speakerToken": "avg_108_silent_1#6$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "别急，你跑太快了，小心弄伤你自己。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "格雷伊",
          "speakerToken": "avg_1027_greyy2_1#7$2",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我观察到，那些物体好像会追着光和人声走。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "格雷伊",
          "speakerToken": "avg_1027_greyy2_1#7$2",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "你们看......"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "speakerToken": "avg_108_silent_1#5$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......它们追着你的法术光球飞远了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "格雷伊",
          "speakerToken": "avg_1027_greyy2_1#5$2",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "哈......只是暂时的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "格雷伊",
          "speakerToken": "avg_1027_greyy2_1#5$2",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我的法术还做不到骗它们更久。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "speakerToken": "avg_108_silent_1#2$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "你尽力了，而且做得很好。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "speakerToken": "avg_108_silent_1#8$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "趋光性吗......你提供了一个有趣的思路。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "speakerToken": "avg_108_silent_1#2$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "格雷伊，你能帮助疏散附近的拓荒者吗？他们信任你。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "speakerToken": "avg_108_silent_1#2$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "请让他们躲在暗处不要出声。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "格雷伊",
          "speakerToken": "avg_1027_greyy2_1#9$2",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "嗯，我知道该怎么做。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "格雷伊",
          "speakerToken": "avg_1027_greyy2_1#9$2",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "类似的工作我跟着前辈们做过很多次了......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "格雷伊",
          "speakerToken": "avg_1027_greyy2_1#6$2",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "赫默医生，您和埃琳娜小姐也请小心。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerToken": "avg_135_halo_1#3$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "那我们呢？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "speakerToken": "avg_108_silent_1#7$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "弄出点动静来。越大越好，起码要掩盖掉其他人的脚步声。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_535_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......好。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_535_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "萨姆，再叫五六个人过来，拿上最能制造噪音的工具。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒队成员",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_534_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "你真准备听他们的？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_535_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "你有更好的主意吗？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒队成员",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_534_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......你说了算，头儿。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "speakerToken": "avg_108_silent_1#7$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "把所有银色物体都引到我们这边来。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerToken": "avg_135_halo_1#3$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "让我们来充当诱饵——然后呢？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫默",
          "speakerToken": "avg_108_silent_1#8$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "先尽量拖延......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "温柔的女声",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "然后来实验区。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_535_1#7$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "这声音......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerToken": "avg_135_halo_1#7$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "多萝西？！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "温柔的女声",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "是的，是我，埃琳娜。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "温柔的女声",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我改装了一下实验室的扩音设备——希望没吓到你们。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerToken": "avg_135_halo_1#3$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "你没事吧？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "温柔的女声",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我很安全，请不必为我担心。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "温柔的女声",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "实验区的建筑更结实，也能为大家抵挡威胁。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "温柔的女声",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "各位——无论是拓荒队的朋友们，还是莱茵的同事们，实验区的大门将为你们打开。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
